}}The '''Blue Dragon Imp''' costume was originally obtained by pre-ordering the [[Online:Elsweyr Collector's Edition|Collector's Edition]] for [[ON:Elsweyr|Elsweyr]]. It is now available in the [[Online:Crown Store|Crown Store]] for {{ESO Crowns|2,100}} as part of the [[Online:Elsweyr Collector's Pack|Elsweyr Collector's Pack]]. The pet flies around while its owner is idle. Its default name is "Dwiindovah".
