==System Mail==
Players who pre-purchased Elsweyr received this correspondence in their in-game mailbox upon opening the game when the Chapter released.
{| class="wikitable" width="40%"
! Pre-Order Bonus Pack
|-
|
''For pre-ordering The Elder Scrolls Online: Elsweyr, you have received these Pre-Order bonus features: <br><br>''
''• The exclusive [[Online:Noble Clan-Chief|Noble Clan-Chief]] Costume<br>''
''• The exclusive Blue Dragon Imp pet<br>''
''• Three Elsweyr Treasure Maps<br>''
''• A [[Online:Baandari Pedlar Crate|Baandari Pedlar Crown Crate]]<br>''
''• Two Crown Experience Scrolls<br><br>
''Your Noble Clan-Chief costume and Blue Dragon Imp pet can be found in your Collections menu. Your Crown Experience Scrolls and Treasure Maps are attached to this mail. Your Crown Crate has been added to your account, and can be opened from the Crown Crates menu. Welcome to Elsweyr!''
|}

==Notes==
*Its name means "Steel Dragon" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].

